{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "bds_monthly_supply",
  "spec": ["building-development 4.1", "building-development 4.13", "building-development 1.3", "building-development 11.4"],
  "description": "Test 4, by hand from 4.1 with float32 steps. Shipped tuning (min 8192, max 20480, 0.5): R 30000, C 12000.5, I 9000.25 -> I + C = 21000.75, + R = 51000.75, x 0.5 = 25500.375 -> trunc 25500 -> clamp 20480 -> SetSupplyValue(20480.0); R 1000, C 200, I 50 -> 250, 1250, 625 -> 8192.0. Code-default tuning (no exemplar: 100, 2000, 0.5): R 3000 -> 1500.0. Extra: a negative sum (R = -1000 -> x = -500) truncates to 0xFFFFFE0C as unsigned, passes max(min) and is clamped to max 2000 [quirk 4.1]; missing census nodes count 0 [choice] -> min 100. A new node starts at supply 100, demand 0 (1.3 step 7). Every monthly run sets state 1 and starts the developers' map rebuilds in ascending type order (the exemplars list 0x3110 before 0x1010: tokens 257 = 0x3110, 258 = 0x1010); a month arriving in state != 0 is skipped (no StartMapUpdate, supply unchanged).",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "bds_process", "seed": 1},
    {"op": "bds_world", "tuning": "shipped", "census": {"0x1001": 30000, "0x3001": 12000.5, "0x4001": 9000.25}},
    {"op": "bds_exemplars", "list": [{"developer": "0x3110"}, {"developer": "0x1010"}]},
    {"op": "bds_create"},
    {"op": "bds_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_expect", "state": {"supply": 100, "demand": 0, "state": 0, "cr_min": 8192, "cr_max": 20480, "cr_per_resident": 0.5, "bias": 10,
      "developers": {"0x1010": 258, "0x3110": 257}}},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "monthly"},
    {"op": "bds_expect", "state": {"supply": 20480, "demand": 0, "state": 1}},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "start_map_update", "dev": 258},
      {"event": "start_map_update", "dev": 257}]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "monthly"},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": []},
    {"op": "bds_set", "state": {"state": 0}},
    {"op": "bds_world", "census": {"0x1001": 1000, "0x3001": 200, "0x4001": 50}},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "monthly"},
    {"op": "bds_expect", "state": {"supply": 8192, "state": 1}},
    {"op": "bds_set", "state": {"state": 2, "supply": 5}},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_expect", "state": {"supply": 5, "state": 2}},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": []},

    {"op": "bds_world", "tuning": null, "census": {"0x1001": 3000, "0x3001": 0, "0x4001": 0}},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "read_tuning"},
    {"op": "bds_expect", "state": {"cr_min": 100, "cr_max": 2000, "cr_per_resident": 0.5, "bias": 10, "stage_multiplier": []}},
    {"op": "bds_set", "state": {"state": 0}},
    {"op": "bds_message", "type": "SimBegin", "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_expect", "state": {"supply": 1500, "state": 1}},
    {"op": "bds_set", "state": {"state": 0}},
    {"op": "bds_world", "census": {"0x1001": -1000, "0x3001": 0, "0x4001": 0}},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "monthly"},
    {"op": "bds_expect", "state": {"supply": 2000}},
    {"op": "bds_set", "state": {"state": 0}},
    {"op": "bds_world", "census": {}},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "monthly"},
    {"op": "bds_expect", "state": {"supply": 100}}
  ]
}
